# Heart of Madness (abyssea 169), the reply kind: a level 99 Warrior in Port Jeuno with the quest accepted, its story
# quests before it, 5 maw quests and the three set quests completed (GMs: their offers would tie). Joachim: 335,
# finished: completed, Tenuous Existence accepted. Tenuous Existence back to available and the quest back to accepted
# (GMs): Joachim again: 335 again. Joachim has his own onTrigger (xi.abyssea.traverserNPCOnTrigger): an Event-rank 335
# would alternate with it (interaction_lookup.lua's UseFallback) and the second talk would go to his script (his 328:
# Dawn of Death accepted or completed).
lists PortJeuno/Joachim/onTrigger PortJeuno/onEventFinish/335
char zone=PortJeuno pos=-51.344,0,-9.978 job=WAR lvl=99
quest Abyssea.AJourneyBegins completed
quest Abyssea.TheTruthBeckons completed
quest Abyssea.DawnOfDeath completed
