quest Abyssea.AnOfficerAndAPirate completed
quest Abyssea.HeartOfMadness accepted
quest Abyssea.AGoldstruckGigas completed
quest Abyssea.ToPasteAPeiste completed
quest Abyssea.MegadrileMenace completed
quest Abyssea.TheBeastOfBastore completed
quest Abyssea.ADelectableDemon completed
quest Abyssea.HeroesOfAbyssea completed
quest Abyssea.ScarsOfAbyssea completed
quest Abyssea.TheForbiddenFrontier completed
login
trigger Joachim                         # 335
finish                                  # completed; Tenuous Existence accepted
quest Abyssea.TenuousExistence available # a GM
quest Abyssea.HeartOfMadness available  # a GM
quest Abyssea.HeartOfMadness accepted   # a GM
trigger Joachim                         # 335 again (the kind)
